```

Each package that has tests gets its own `vitest.config.ts`.

## Important Notes

- Use `type: "module"` in all package.json files
- Use `.ts` extensions in imports within packages (Drizzle and other tools require it)
- Each package's tsconfig.json extends `../../tsconfig.base.json`
- Package names follow `@chief-mog-officer/<name>` convention
- Use workspace protocol for internal deps: `"@chief-mog-officer/types": "workspace:*"`
